==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2.67~8 seconds<sup>80f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Red Cyclone and Mr. Mole here make a deadly combination. Red Cyclone has 1 knockback and must be Frozen/Slowed or it will push at insane speeds, while [[Mr. Mole]] hides behind the [[Red Cyclone]] and destroys your stack with its rapid Long Distance + knockback ability.

[[Mr. Mole]] has an attack frequency of 4 seconds and an LD of 350-900, so any unit with less than 5 speed, fore-swing close to 4 seconds, or units with at less than 9000 hp shouldn't be used.

Most CC unique units such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]], [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]], [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer]], or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] will be able to reach the cyclone if they are leveled enough.

Even just [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] + CC will work eventually. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can help massively with this stage, as they have low fore-swing and can survive [[Mr. Mole]] repeatedly.

In general, stall at the start for wallet and to stack up CC units, get 3-4 CC units stacked then deploy more attackers to push to the base. Cyclone should be slowed/frozen as soon as he spawns. Constantly send a stream of CC and attackers. If the cyclone is slowed/frozen, send [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] which will almost instantly kill the cyclone. Otherwise just continue to spam CC and attackers.

